      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow collecting items:\n\nServer:\nGame.php --> new function for item like checkCollectionBalls --> call function in finalizeTurn, add to state = $this-> getObjectFromDb..., add to notify all\n\nClient:\ntypes.d.ts --> add new item to interface NotifTurnFinalizedArgs\nGame.ts --> new private function like renderColelctionTrack for new Item to render scoretrack --> In \"Setup Player Boards add div for track -->\n                        \"Set up tracks and covered cells\" add this.render... --> add to async notif_turnFinalized --> update css for the classes of track and circle\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow collecting items:\n\nServer:\nGame.php --> new function for item like checkCollectionBalls --> call function in finalizeTurn, add to state = $this-> getObjectFromDb..., add to notify all\n\nClient:\ntypes.d.ts --> add new item to interface NotifTurnFinalizedArgs\nGame.ts --> new private function like renderColelctionTrack for new Item to render scoretrack --> In \"Setup Player Boards add div for track -->\n                        \"Set up tracks and covered cells\" add this.render... --> add to async notif_turnFinalized --> update css for the classes of track and circle\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
